# um-texts 1
=== SPELL acid_column
Acid fountain
This is an area effect spell. A fountain of acid causes damage to everyone around.

=== SPELL acid_fog
Acid fog
This spell is directed at a location and not at a specific target. It causes acid damage to everyone inside the fog.

=== SPELL acid_ray
Acid blast
A spray of acid which always hits the target.

=== SPELL antimagic
Protection from magic
This spell protects you from the Magic of any of the three Elements.

=== SPELL arrow
Fire arrow
An arrow of fire which always hits the target.

=== SPELL clairvoyence
Clairvoyance
Allows you to see enemies around the point at which the spell is directed.

=== SPELL curse_magic
Astral Burst
A torrent of pure astral energy always striking the opponent it was aimed at.
=== SPELL detect_life
Celestial Sense
Allows the target to sense all creatures within a certain range of them.

=== SPELL eagle_sight
Eagle sight
Increases the range of your sight by one and a half times.

=== SPELL enlarge
Enlargement
Enlarges the size of the object hit by the spell.

=== SPELL feeblemind
Feeblemind
Prevents your enemy from casting spells for some time (to cast this spell, the target must be visible).

=== SPELL fireball
Fireball
This is an area effect spell. The fireball will cause damage to everyone near the explosion.

=== SPELL firewall
Fire wall
This is an area effect spell. A wall of fierce fire damages everyone within its range.

=== SPELL fireworks
Fireworks
Will only attract the attention of an enemy who sees or hears it, without raising a general alarm.

=== SPELL healing
Healing
Restores health damaged in combat.

=== SPELL infravision
Night vision
Enables one to see as well in darkness as in daylight.

=== SPELL inv_lit
Celestial lightning
This is an area effect spell. The lightning strike causes damage to everyone who is close by.

=== SPELL invisibility
Invisibility
This spell doubles your invisibility to enemies.

=== SPELL lichdom
Deadbolt
Makes the target immune to Sky Sense, the way undead detect the living.

=== SPELL lightning
Lightning
A lightning strike which always hits the target.

=== SPELL litnwall
Lightning barrier
This is an area effect spell. The barrier causes lightning damage to anyone trying to cross it.

=== SPELL prot_acid
Protection from acid
The person protected by this spell becomes less vulnerable to acid effects.

=== SPELL prot_electro
Protection from lightning
The person protected by this spell becomes less vulnerable to lightning effects.

=== SPELL prot_fire
Protection from fire
The person protected by this spell becomes less vulnerable to the effects of fire.

=== SPELL regeneration
Regeneration
Increases the speed of health recovery.

=== SPELL rick_magic
Ruin
A powerful strike, always getting into the opponent it targets.

=== SPELL shrink
Shrinking
This shrinks the target object.

=== SPELL silence
Silence
This doubles your "silence" value making it twice harder for the enemy to hear you.

=== SPELL slow
Deceleration
Allows you to slow down the speed of blows which are struck and of spell casting.

=== SPELL speed
Haste
Allows you to increase the speed of blows which are struck and of spell casting.

=== SPELL strength
Strengthen
Allows you to temporarily increase a character's health and the damage he can cause to enemies.

=== SPELL stun
Paralysis
Allows to paralyse your enemy for a certain period of time (to cast it, the enemy must be visible to you).

=== SPELL teleport
Teleportation
Instant displacement from one point to another (to cast this spell, you must see the destination).

=== SPELL vision_fog
Field of vision
Allows you to see what the spell's target is seeing...

=== SPELL weak
Weaken
Allows you to temporarily weaken your opponent and lessen the damage he can cause.

